<BlogPost slug="is-iptv-safe-canada">
  <p>Not every IPTV seller is the same, and the market has plenty of look-alike sites. Here is a practical way to check safety before you pay anyone.</p>

  <h2>Green flags</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>A free trial with no credit card.</strong> You can test before you spend anything.</li>
    <li><strong>Clear prices and plan lengths</strong> shown openly, with no hidden fees.</li>
    <li><strong>A written refund policy</strong> and a money-back window.</li>
    <li><strong>Real contact details,</strong> including a phone number, email and a way to reach support.</li>
    <li><strong>Published terms and privacy policy</strong> that explain what data is collected.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Red flags</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pressure to pay immediately, or to pay only by gift card or untraceable methods.</li>
    <li>No trial, no refund policy and no named contact.</li>
    <li>Prices that look impossibly low, such as "lifetime" for a tiny one-off fee.</li>
    <li>Asking for far more personal information than an order needs.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Protecting your money and data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the trial first, and confirm the channels you need.</li>
    <li>Send only the details needed to deliver your login.</li>
    <li>Keep your order messages and receipts.</li>
    <li>Use a strong, unique password for any account you create.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How Prime IPTV works</h2>
  <p>You can start a <a href="/free-trial/">24-hour trial without a credit card</a>. Plans are listed on the <a href="/pricing/">pricing page</a>, a <a href="/refund/">7-day money-back guarantee</a> applies, and there is no contract. When you press Buy Now, WhatsApp opens with your plan in the message, and we send payment details there.</p>

  <h2>Quick answers</h2>
  <h3>Is a free trial safe?</h3>
  <p>Yes, if it asks for no card. Be cautious about any "free" trial that needs card details.</p>
  <h3>What if something goes wrong?</h3>
  <p>Contact us right away on WhatsApp or by email. The refund policy explains how to request a refund within the 7-day window.</p>
